Russia will build between 70-105 Il-114-300 aircraft for India.

The United Aircraft Corporation has signed agreements to supply 50 aircraft for the Pinnacle Air airline and up to 20 aircraft for the Air Kerala airline. A memorandum of understanding was also signed with Sleek Aviation, on the supply of 35 aircraft but has not yet been finalised as a contract.

